# Terror Tide: "All creatures get -X/-X until end of turn, where X is the number of permanent cards in your graveyard" (CR 110.4a).
# Casting it sacrifices the Black Lotus, the only permanent card in Bot1's graveyard, so X is 1 (the sorcery itself is not a permanent
# card): both Memnites (1/1) die, one of each player's, and Bot2's 0/2 Ornithopter survives as a -1/1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Terror Tide
Memnite
Swamp x3
Swamp x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Ornithopter
Island x5
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Terror Tide.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Memnite; Terror Tide; Black Lotus
Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = -1
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 1
